<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The SDK's OWN user-facing strings (I18N-PLAN D14/W8) — the neutral culture.

  Everything a built-in component says or announces lives here and nowhere else, so a 100%
  Portuguese app never announces "Checked" to VoiceOver. The file sits BESIDE the Designer at the
  package's tools/source root on purpose: the app's build resolves a resource class's variants by
  walking from its Designer path, so this layout is what makes the SDK's keys join every app's
  culture catalogs without the app authoring anything.
-->
